Release @VERSION@

## Installation

### Using Helm (OCI Registry)

```bash
helm install evroc-ccm oci://ghcr.io/@REPOSITORY_OWNER@/charts/evroc-ccm --version @VERSION_NO_V@
```

### Using Helm (GitHub Release)

```bash
helm install evroc-ccm https://github.com/@REPOSITORY@/releases/download/@VERSION@/evroc-ccm-@VERSION_NO_V@.tgz
```

## Container Images

- `ghcr.io/@REPOSITORY@:@VERSION@`
- Signed with Cosign (keyless)
- SBOM and SLSA provenance attestations available

## Verification

Verify the image signature:

```bash
cosign verify ghcr.io/@REPOSITORY@:@VERSION@ \
  --certificate-identity=https://github.com/@REPOSITORY@/.github/workflows/release.yml@refs/tags/@VERSION@ \
  --certificate-oidc-issuer=https://token.actions.githubusercontent.com
```

Verify the Helm chart signature:

```bash
cosign verify-blob evroc-ccm-@VERSION_NO_V@.tgz \
  --bundle evroc-ccm-@VERSION_NO_V@.tgz.bundle \
  --certificate-identity=https://github.com/@REPOSITORY@/.github/workflows/release.yml@refs/tags/@VERSION@ \
  --certificate-oidc-issuer=https://token.actions.githubusercontent.com
```
